<title>UK: SOCCER-NEWCASTLE SIGN BRADFORD'S HAMILTON.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NEWCASTLE SIGN BRADFORD'S HAMILTON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league club Newcastle on Wednesday signed Bradford City midfielder Des Hamilton for 1.5 million pounds ($2.4 million).</p>
<p>First division Bradford will receive a further 500,000 pounds ($800,000) once Hamilton has made a certain number of first-team appearances and will host Newcastle in a friendly before the start of next season.</p>
